{
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowS",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}/1000),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "since",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${nowS}-172800),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "时间窗下界(秒)。⚠️ 必须 `parseNumber(...,0)` 取整:calc 的结果直接拼进 URL 时带小数位会让 Algolia 的 numericFilters 解析成另一个数。"
    },
    {
      "action": "request",
      "id": "resp",
      "params": {
        "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search?tags=show_hn&numericFilters=created_at_i%3E${since}&hitsPerPage=10&attributesToRetrieve=title,url,points,num_comments,author,created_at_i,objectID&attributesToHighlight=none",
        "method": "GET",
        "formatType": "json"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp.hits}),0),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "hn_show_unreachable"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "取数失败 → 抛错终止流,平台据此回落上次成功数据(G26/§7.2)"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},HH:mm)]"
      },
      "_note": "榜单本身没有「数据时间」字段,用取数时刻兜底 —— 没有时间锚点的榜单看不出是不是几小时前的旧数据(标准 §4.4)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h0",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[0].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      },
      "_note": "上榜小时数下限钳 1:刚上榜几分钟的帖子除出来的速率会是几千,把整条比例尺拉爆,别的行全变成一根针。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v0",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.hits[0].points}/${h0}),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h1",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[1].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.hits[1].points}/${h1}),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h2",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[2].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v2",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.hits[2].points}/${h2}),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h3",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[3].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v3",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.hits[3].points}/${h3}),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h4",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[4].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v4",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.hits[4].points}/${h4}),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h5",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[5].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v5",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.hits[5].points}/${h5}),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h6",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[6].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v6",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.hits[6].points}/${h6}),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h7",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[7].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v7",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.hits[7].points}/${h7}),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h8",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[8].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v8",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.hits[8].points}/${h8}),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h9",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[9].created_at_i})/3600),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v9",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.hits[9].points}/${h9}),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_vs",
        "value": [
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${v0},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${v1},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${v2},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${v3},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${v4},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${v5},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${v6},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${v7},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${v8},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${v9},0)]"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "vmax",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::(max::(${_vs})),1)]"
      },
      "_note": "归一化分母 = 前十里最快的那条。⚠️ 下限 1(勿删):首页整体极冷时 vmax 可能是 0,除零会让所有条宽变成非数 → points 串解析失败 → **整卡**渲染返回 null。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "reTl",
        "value": "[ ]+[^ ]*$"
      },
      "_note": "截断后退到上一个词边界(英文)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "reTp",
        "value": "[-,;:.–—/ ]+$"
      },
      "_note": "截断处的句尾标点 / 空格剥掉再补省略号。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "reAs",
        "value": "[ -~]"
      },
      "_note": "可打印 ASCII —— 剥掉它们剩下的就是宽字符(中日韩)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tr0",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(${resp.hits[0].title},^Show HN:[ ]*,)]"
      },
      "_note": "去掉标题里与表头重复的那截前缀 —— 每行省下 9 个字符,给真正的内容。⚠️ 正则里**不写 `\\s`**:表达式分词器把反斜杠当转义(dfkit 的 `join::(…,\\,)` 就是靠它),`\\s` 会被吃成字面量 `s`。用字符类 `[ ]*` 表达同一件事,且已有先例(appwatch 的 `[0-9]+x[0-9]+bb.[a-z]+`)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p0",
        "value": "${resp.hits[0].points}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c0",
        "value": "${resp.hits[0].num_comments}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g0",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h0},0)]"
      },
      "_note": "上榜小时数取整(结论行「最近 24 小时新上榜」按它数)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "b0",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(max::(calc::(findNotEmpty::(${v0},0)*1.25*90.0/(findNotEmpty::(${v0},0)+${vmax}/4)),6),0.0)]"
      },
      "_note": "热度条像素宽 = 饱和比例 f(v)=1.25·v/(v+峰值/4)(2026-10-08 由线性改):f(峰值)=1、f(峰值/4)=0.625 ——与 √ 一样把挤在低端的大多数摊开。线性时 Ask HN 第 1 条 546 分,第 2–5 条只剩 3–5px,条就失去了作用。下限 6 = 一个圆头的直径。90.0 与 .rcn 逐字对应。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "id0",
        "value": "${resp.hits[0].objectID}"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 提成**顶层标量**:整卡 onClick 的插值只认顶层标量键,嵌套路径 ${resp.hits[0].objectID} 一律取空。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0L",
        "value": "$[length::(${tr0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0N",
        "value": "$[length::(replaceAll::(${tr0},${reAs},))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0W",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(${t0L}+${t0N}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0K",
        "value": "$[round::(min::(floor::(calc::(${t0L}*80/max::(${t0W},1))),${t0L}))]"
      },
      "_note": "截到第几个字:按本条的平均字宽把预算折成字数。round 是为了 Android 上 floor 返回 double。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${t0W},80),connect::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(subString::(${tr0},0,${t0K}),${reTl},),${reTp},),…),${tr0})]"
      },
      "_note": "超出 80 个宽度单位才截:按词退一格、剥句尾标点、补「…」(线上宿主的文本节点出不了省略号)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "am0",
        "value": "$[max::(floor::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[0].created_at_i})/60)),1)]"
      },
      "_note": "发帖距今分钟数 → 「N 小时前 / Nh ago」(与 lobsters / v2ex / hfpapers 同一种写法)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "a0",
        "value": "$[round::(if::(lt::(${am0},60),${am0},if::(lt::(${am0},2880),floor::(calc::(${am0}/60)),floor::(calc::(${am0}/1440)))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u0",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${am0},60),1,if::(lt::(${am0},2880),2,3))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l0",
        "value": "$[if::(le::(${t0W},36),1,2)]"
      },
      "_note": "标题估计排几行:1 行时行内内容整体居中。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tr1",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(${resp.hits[1].title},^Show HN:[ ]*,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p1",
        "value": "${resp.hits[1].points}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c1",
        "value": "${resp.hits[1].num_comments}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h1},0)]"
      },
      "_note": "上榜小时数取整(结论行「最近 24 小时新上榜」按它数)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "b1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(max::(calc::(findNotEmpty::(${v1},0)*1.25*90.0/(findNotEmpty::(${v1},0)+${vmax}/4)),6),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "id1",
        "value": "${resp.hits[1].objectID}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t1L",
        "value": "$[length::(${tr1})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t1N",
        "value": "$[length::(replaceAll::(${tr1},${reAs},))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t1W",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(${t1L}+${t1N}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t1K",
        "value": "$[round::(min::(floor::(calc::(${t1L}*80/max::(${t1W},1))),${t1L}))]"
      },
      "_note": "截到第几个字:按本条的平均字宽把预算折成字数。round 是为了 Android 上 floor 返回 double。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t1",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${t1W},80),connect::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(subString::(${tr1},0,${t1K}),${reTl},),${reTp},),…),${tr1})]"
      },
      "_note": "超出 80 个宽度单位才截:按词退一格、剥句尾标点、补「…」(线上宿主的文本节点出不了省略号)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "am1",
        "value": "$[max::(floor::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[1].created_at_i})/60)),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "a1",
        "value": "$[round::(if::(lt::(${am1},60),${am1},if::(lt::(${am1},2880),floor::(calc::(${am1}/60)),floor::(calc::(${am1}/1440)))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u1",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${am1},60),1,if::(lt::(${am1},2880),2,3))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l1",
        "value": "$[if::(le::(${t1W},36),1,2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tr2",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(${resp.hits[2].title},^Show HN:[ ]*,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p2",
        "value": "${resp.hits[2].points}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c2",
        "value": "${resp.hits[2].num_comments}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g2",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h2},0)]"
      },
      "_note": "上榜小时数取整(结论行「最近 24 小时新上榜」按它数)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "b2",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(max::(calc::(findNotEmpty::(${v2},0)*1.25*90.0/(findNotEmpty::(${v2},0)+${vmax}/4)),6),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "id2",
        "value": "${resp.hits[2].objectID}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t2L",
        "value": "$[length::(${tr2})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t2N",
        "value": "$[length::(replaceAll::(${tr2},${reAs},))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t2W",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(${t2L}+${t2N}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t2K",
        "value": "$[round::(min::(floor::(calc::(${t2L}*80/max::(${t2W},1))),${t2L}))]"
      },
      "_note": "截到第几个字:按本条的平均字宽把预算折成字数。round 是为了 Android 上 floor 返回 double。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t2",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${t2W},80),connect::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(subString::(${tr2},0,${t2K}),${reTl},),${reTp},),…),${tr2})]"
      },
      "_note": "超出 80 个宽度单位才截:按词退一格、剥句尾标点、补「…」(线上宿主的文本节点出不了省略号)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "am2",
        "value": "$[max::(floor::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[2].created_at_i})/60)),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "a2",
        "value": "$[round::(if::(lt::(${am2},60),${am2},if::(lt::(${am2},2880),floor::(calc::(${am2}/60)),floor::(calc::(${am2}/1440)))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u2",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${am2},60),1,if::(lt::(${am2},2880),2,3))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l2",
        "value": "$[if::(le::(${t2W},36),1,2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tr3",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(${resp.hits[3].title},^Show HN:[ ]*,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p3",
        "value": "${resp.hits[3].points}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c3",
        "value": "${resp.hits[3].num_comments}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g3",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h3},0)]"
      },
      "_note": "上榜小时数取整(结论行「最近 24 小时新上榜」按它数)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "b3",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(max::(calc::(findNotEmpty::(${v3},0)*1.25*90.0/(findNotEmpty::(${v3},0)+${vmax}/4)),6),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "id3",
        "value": "${resp.hits[3].objectID}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t3L",
        "value": "$[length::(${tr3})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t3N",
        "value": "$[length::(replaceAll::(${tr3},${reAs},))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t3W",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(${t3L}+${t3N}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t3K",
        "value": "$[round::(min::(floor::(calc::(${t3L}*80/max::(${t3W},1))),${t3L}))]"
      },
      "_note": "截到第几个字:按本条的平均字宽把预算折成字数。round 是为了 Android 上 floor 返回 double。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t3",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${t3W},80),connect::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(subString::(${tr3},0,${t3K}),${reTl},),${reTp},),…),${tr3})]"
      },
      "_note": "超出 80 个宽度单位才截:按词退一格、剥句尾标点、补「…」(线上宿主的文本节点出不了省略号)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "am3",
        "value": "$[max::(floor::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[3].created_at_i})/60)),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "a3",
        "value": "$[round::(if::(lt::(${am3},60),${am3},if::(lt::(${am3},2880),floor::(calc::(${am3}/60)),floor::(calc::(${am3}/1440)))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u3",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${am3},60),1,if::(lt::(${am3},2880),2,3))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l3",
        "value": "$[if::(le::(${t3W},36),1,2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tr4",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(${resp.hits[4].title},^Show HN:[ ]*,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p4",
        "value": "${resp.hits[4].points}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c4",
        "value": "${resp.hits[4].num_comments}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g4",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${h4},0)]"
      },
      "_note": "上榜小时数取整(结论行「最近 24 小时新上榜」按它数)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "b4",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(max::(calc::(findNotEmpty::(${v4},0)*1.25*90.0/(findNotEmpty::(${v4},0)+${vmax}/4)),6),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "id4",
        "value": "${resp.hits[4].objectID}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t4L",
        "value": "$[length::(${tr4})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t4N",
        "value": "$[length::(replaceAll::(${tr4},${reAs},))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t4W",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(${t4L}+${t4N}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t4K",
        "value": "$[round::(min::(floor::(calc::(${t4L}*80/max::(${t4W},1))),${t4L}))]"
      },
      "_note": "截到第几个字:按本条的平均字宽把预算折成字数。round 是为了 Android 上 floor 返回 double。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t4",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${t4W},80),connect::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(subString::(${tr4},0,${t4K}),${reTl},),${reTp},),…),${tr4})]"
      },
      "_note": "超出 80 个宽度单位才截:按词退一格、剥句尾标点、补「…」(线上宿主的文本节点出不了省略号)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "am4",
        "value": "$[max::(floor::(calc::((${nowS}-${resp.hits[4].created_at_i})/60)),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "a4",
        "value": "$[round::(if::(lt::(${am4},60),${am4},if::(lt::(${am4},2880),floor::(calc::(${am4}/60)),floor::(calc::(${am4}/1440)))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u4",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${am4},60),1,if::(lt::(${am4},2880),2,3))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l4",
        "value": "$[if::(le::(${t4W},36),1,2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "resultFilter",
      "params": {
        "keys": [
          "at",
          "t0",
          "p0",
          "c0",
          "g0",
          "b0",
          "id0",
          "a0",
          "u0",
          "l0",
          "t1",
          "p1",
          "c1",
          "g1",
          "b1",
          "id1",
          "a1",
          "u1",
          "l1",
          "t2",
          "p2",
          "c2",
          "g2",
          "b2",
          "id2",
          "a2",
          "u2",
          "l2",
          "t3",
          "p3",
          "c3",
          "g3",
          "b3",
          "id3",
          "a3",
          "u3",
          "l3",
          "t4",
          "p4",
          "c4",
          "g4",
          "b4",
          "id4",
          "a4",
          "u4",
          "l4"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
